msgid "empty command"
msgstr "perintah kosong"

msgid "%(program)s: %(error)s"
msgstr "%(program)s: %(error)s"

msgid "%(program)s: not found"
msgstr "%(program)s: tidak dijumpai"

msgid "no output"
msgstr "tiada keluaran"

msgid "exit code %(code)d: %(detail)s"
msgstr "exit code %(code)d: %(detail)s"

msgid "llama.cpp not found: no llama-server on PATH, in LLAMA_CPP_PATH or in the usual directories"
msgstr "llama.cpp tidak dijumpai: tiada llama-server pada PATH, dalam LLAMA_CPP_PATH atau dalam direktori yang biasa"

msgid "no ggml backend libraries found next to llama-server; the build may be static"
msgstr "tiada pustaka backend ggml di sebelah llama-server; binaannya mungkin static"

msgid "no llama-server answering"
msgstr "tiada llama-server yang menjawab"

msgid "unexpected response: %(error)s"
msgstr "respons tidak dijangka: %(error)s"

msgid "Install or repair the NVIDIA driver; nvidia-smi ships with it and must be on PATH."
msgstr "Pasang atau baiki pemacu NVIDIA; nvidia-smi datang bersamanya dan mesti ada pada PATH."

msgid "Install ROCm (Linux) to expose AMD VRAM figures; without it the GPU is listed by name only."
msgstr "Pasang ROCm (Linux) supaya angka VRAM AMD kelihatan; tanpanya GPU hanya disenaraikan mengikut nama."

msgid "PowerShell could not list video controllers; run from a normal user session."
msgstr "PowerShell tidak dapat menyenaraikan pengawal video; jalankan daripada sesi pengguna biasa."

msgid "Install pciutils to list GPUs by name when no vendor tool is available."
msgstr "Pasang pciutils untuk menyenaraikan GPU mengikut nama apabila tiada alat vendor tersedia."

msgid "DDR type and speed were not readable; on Linux run once with sudo (dmidecode) or accept the measured bandwidth instead."
msgstr "Jenis dan kelajuan DDR tidak dapat dibaca; pada Linux jalankan sekali dengan sudo (dmidecode) atau terima sahaja bandwidth yang diukur."

msgid "py-cpuinfo failed; the CPU model and instruction sets are unknown."
msgstr "py-cpuinfo gagal; model CPU dan set arahannya tidak diketahui."

msgid "psutil could not count the CPU cores; thread choice falls back to one core. Reinstall psutil with `pip install --force-reinstall psutil`."
msgstr "psutil tidak dapat mengira teras CPU; pemilihan thread berpatah balik kepada satu teras. Pasang semula psutil dengan `pip install --force-reinstall psutil`."

msgid "psutil could not read the memory totals; budgets cannot be computed until this works. Reinstall psutil with `pip install --force-reinstall psutil`."
msgstr "psutil tidak dapat membaca jumlah memori; belanjawan tidak dapat dikira sehingga ini berjaya. Pasang semula psutil dengan `pip install --force-reinstall psutil`."

msgid "Could not read performance-core count from sysctl."
msgstr "Tidak dapat membaca bilangan teras prestasi daripada sysctl."

msgid "llama-server exists but did not report a version; the binary may be broken."
msgstr "llama-server wujud tetapi tidak melaporkan versi; binarinya mungkin rosak."

msgid "system_profiler failed; GPU information is unavailable."
msgstr "system_profiler gagal; maklumat GPU tidak tersedia."

msgid "No vendor tool reported the GPU's memory size; record the size in a hardware profile so budgets can be computed for this machine."
msgstr "Tiada alat vendor yang melaporkan saiz memori GPU; catatkan saiznya dalam sebuah hardware profile supaya belanjawan dapat dikira untuk mesin ini."

msgid "llama.cpp installed"
msgstr "llama.cpp dipasang"

msgid "build %(build)s at %(path)s, backends: %(backends)s"
msgstr "binaan %(build)s di %(path)s, backend: %(backends)s"

msgctxt "llama.cpp build"
msgid "unknown"
msgstr "tidak diketahui"

msgid "llama.cpp not found"
msgstr "llama.cpp tidak dijumpai"

msgid "no llama-server binary was found"
msgstr "tiada binari llama-server dijumpai"

msgid "Install llama.cpp (LlamaFit phase 2 will do this: `llamafit install llama.cpp`); until then download a release from https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases and put its bin directory on PATH or in LLAMA_CPP_PATH."
msgstr "Pasang llama.cpp (fasa 2 LlamaFit akan melakukannya: `llamafit install llama.cpp`); sementara itu muat turun keluaran daripada https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/releases dan letakkan direktori bin-nya pada PATH atau dalam LLAMA_CPP_PATH."

msgid "Memory size unknown"
msgstr "Saiz memori tidak diketahui"

msgid "LlamaFit could not read this machine's memory totals, so it cannot work out what will fit."
msgstr "LlamaFit tidak dapat membaca jumlah memori mesin ini, jadi ia tidak dapat menentukan apa yang muat."

msgid "%(gpu)s: no %(backend)s backend in llama.cpp"
msgstr "%(gpu)s: tiada backend %(backend)s dalam llama.cpp"

msgid "llama.cpp was built with: %(backends)s"
msgstr "llama.cpp dibina dengan: %(backends)s"

msgctxt "backends"
msgid "unknown"
msgstr "tidak diketahui"

msgid "Install a llama.cpp build with the %(backend)s or Vulkan backend to use %(gpu)s."
msgstr "Pasang binaan llama.cpp dengan backend %(backend)s atau Vulkan untuk menggunakan %(gpu)s."

msgid "%(gpu)s: VRAM size unknown"
msgstr "%(gpu)s: saiz VRAM tidak diketahui"

msgid "the vendor tool that reports memory was not available"
msgstr "alat vendor yang melaporkan memori tidak tersedia"

msgid "No GPU detected"
msgstr "Tiada GPU dikesan"

msgid "models will run on the CPU only"
msgstr "model hanya akan berjalan pada CPU"

msgid "If a GPU is present, check that its driver tools are installed."
msgstr "Jika ada GPU, pastikan alat pemacunya dipasang."

msgid "RAM bandwidth assumed"
msgstr "Bandwidth RAM diandaikan"

msgid "using %(gbps)s GB/s as a default"
msgstr "menggunakan %(gbps)s GB/s sebagai lalai"

msgid "Install numpy (`pip install llamafit[fast]`) so LlamaFit can measure the RAM bandwidth."
msgstr "Pasang numpy (`pip install llamafit[fast]`) supaya LlamaFit dapat mengukur bandwidth RAM."

msgid "Probe %(probe)s failed"
msgstr "Pemeriksaan %(probe)s gagal"

msgctxt "probe error"
msgid "unknown error"
msgstr "ralat tidak diketahui"

msgid "llama-server running at %(url)s"
msgstr "llama-server berjalan di %(url)s"

msgid "model %(model)s, context %(context)s"
msgstr "model %(model)s, konteks %(context)s"

msgctxt "model name"
msgid "unknown"
msgstr "tidak diketahui"

msgid "Low disk space on %(path)s"
msgstr "Ruang cakera rendah pada %(path)s"

msgid "%(size)s free"
msgstr "%(size)s kosong"

msgid "Most useful models need 5 to 120 GB; free space or change the downloads directory."
msgstr "Kebanyakan model yang berguna memerlukan 5 hingga 120 GB; kosongkan ruang atau tukar direktori muat turun."

msgctxt "thousands separator"
msgid ","
msgstr ","

msgctxt "decimal separator"
msgid "."
msgstr "."

# B is not the English word for a thousand million; it is how these models are named.
# The file is Qwen3-27B and the identifier in this row already says 27B, so a localised
# abbreviation would make one row disagree with itself. Change it only if your readers
# genuinely would not recognise B, and say in a comment here why.
msgctxt "parameter count"
msgid "B"
msgstr "B"

